
```catala
declaration scope S:
  output a content date

scope S:
  definition a equals Date.of_year_month_day of (31, 2, 2023)
```


```catala-test-cli
$ catala test-scope S
┌─[ERROR]─
│
│  During evaluation: |0031-02-2023| is not a valid date.
│
├─➤ tests/date/bad/lib_exn.catala_en:7.23-45:
│   │
│ 7 │   definition a equals Date.of_year_month_day of (31, 2, 2023)
│   │                       ‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾
└─
#return code 123#
```

```catala
declaration scope Huge:
  output a content date

scope Huge:
  definition a equals Date.of_year_month_day of (18446744073709551617, 2, 1)
